  "label": "User projected onto the lion as non-conformist persona",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'lion' and the textual entity 'I'm not one of those people' through the use of the first-person declaration. The user identifies with the lion's defiant expression and the self-assertive text, positioning themselves as the non-conformist persona. This projection is explicit through the deictic 'I' in the text, which directly addresses the viewer as the speaker and invites identification with the lion's symbolic role.",
